cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VarDictRust in published research, please cite both the original VarDict publication (Lai et al. 2016) and this software implementation."
title: "VarDictRust: Memory-Safe, High-Performance Variant Calling for NGS"
abstract: "VarDictRust is an idiomatic Rust rewrite of VarDictJava v1.8.3, consolidating its fragmented Java->R->Perl pipeline into a single, memory-safe, statically-compiled binary that scales to deep whole-genome sequencing with bounded memory."
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license:
